{"application/json":{"schema":{"properties":{"data":{"properties":{"items":{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Category"},"type":"array"},"total":{"type":"integer"}},"type":"object"}},"required":["data"],"type":"object"}}},"description":"Every category."},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthorized"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Forbidden"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"}},"summary":"List categories","tags":["Menu"],"x-scope":"menu:read"}},"/menu/products":{"get":{"description":"Every product on the venue's menu, including what is off right now (`available: false`). Default order is the order the menu prints: `position`, then `name`.\n\nScope: `menu:read`.\n\nFilterable: `id`, `category`, `station`, `available`, `popular`, `vegetarian`, `spicy`, `price`, `prepMinutes`.\n\nSortable: `id`, `name`, `price`, `position`, `category`, `prepMinutes`.\n\nExpandable: `modifierGroups`, `translations`.","operationId":"listProducts","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/limit"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/offset"},{"description":"`field asc` or `field desc`. Repeatable.","examples":{"byPrice":{"value":["price desc"]}},"explode":true,"in":"query","name":"sort","schema":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"style":"form"},{"description":"Conditions joined by `AND`. See Filtering.","examples":{"available":{"value":"category = 'Salads' AND available = true"}},"in":"query","name":"where","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/expand"}],"responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"example":{"data":{"items":[{"allergens":[],"available":true,"category":"Main","description":"Saffron rice with lamb","discountable":true,"hasModifiers":true,"id":"0b6f3c1e-9a1d-4a53-8f39-2d1f6c7e5a10","image":"https://api.noosh24.com/api/v1/menu-media/5c1d.jpg","name":"Plov","popular":true,"position":3,"prepMinutes":20,"price":14.5,"spicy":false,"station":"","vatRate":null,"vegetarian":false,"video":null}],"limit":20,